title: Bed3B
---
// Talk target of his bed in 3B (Interact layer).
-> Go to sleep <<if visited("Route1Thu2Dinner")>>
    <<if visited("PhoneThursday2Night")>>
        <<next_scene Route1Thu2End>>
    <<else>>
        You: My phone first. It's been buzzing since I got in.
    <<endif>>
-> Put the blush socks on <<if $item_blush_socks and visited("Route1Thu2Start") and not visited("Route1Thu2Door")>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks_at to "">>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to false>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks to "on">>
    You: Fine. Blush.
-> Look
    You: My bed. A mattress on the floor, made for once.
===
